* tb_alu4_gate_energy.cir  energy per operation of the 4-bit ALU, gate-level cells (NAND-based XOR, multiplexer and full adder)
* 200 vectors of 5 ns: for each of the 8 operations one change to the operation and then
* 24 random operand changes. V(win) is 1 during the 192 random operand changes; the energy
* drawn from the ALU supply during them, divided by 192, is the energy per operation.
* Data are saved from 5 ns. Measurement:
*   e_op_fJ   energy per operation in fJ (average over the 8 operations)
* Ngspice 46 (project flow): 2039.6 fJ
.include tsmc018.lib
.include cells_gate.lib
.include alu4_gate.lib
.options plotwinsize=0
.subckt inv_x1 A Y vdd vss
M0 Y A vss vss nfet w=1u l=0.2u ad=0.5p as=0.5p pd=3u ps=3u
M1 Y A vdd vdd pfet w=2u l=0.2u ad=1p as=1p pd=5u ps=5u
.ends inv_x1
Vdut vdd_dut 0 1.8
Vdrv vdrv 0 1.8
Vld vld 0 1.8
